{"title":"Sirocco Core","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dust Devil, Sand Devil</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>Every gem transmuter has a <b>Reagent</b> tab, the Dark Witch included. This reagent and <b>500 gold</b> get you a <a href=\"#/item/gem-pearl\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\">Pearl</a> of <b>1c, 1.5c or 2c</b>. Monsters no longer drop reagents.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a>.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - dropped it in 1 of 60 looted corpses (1/60)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/60<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - dropped it in 1 of 258 looted corpses (1/258)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/258<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"sirocco-core\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/427c7901fb103b102026.svg\" alt=\"Sirocco Core\"></div><h3>Sirocco Core</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/17/2026, 7:30:43 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}